== Overview ==
'''Assassin Toilet''' is an extremely fast but weak [[Toilets|enemy]] which usually appears in the middle-game.The '''Assassin Toilet''' is one of the hardest toilet to kill if you have a Low CD/High DPS unit attacking it. 

== Appearance ==
He looks like a regular toilet but with a black leather hat.

