==Strategy==
*The '''Assassin Toilet''' is extremely fast and usually appears in groups, making high cooldown units struggle with it.
*[[Speakerman]] and [[Large Speakerman]] are good starter units against the Assassin Toilet because of their low cooldown.
*You can use [[TV Woman]], [[Mech Cameraman]], [[Green Laser Cameraman]], [[Flamethrower Cameraman]], and [[Toxic Upgraded Titan Cameraman]] to slow this enemy down.
==Trivia== 
*Assassin Toilet has a special movement animation where it moves slightly out of the path. It is unknown if this is intentional or not.
*It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Hat_Skibidi_Toilet Assassin Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
*This is one of the fastest enemies in the game, the [[Glitch Toilet]] being the fastest.
*It does 100 damage to the base.

